# Pre-ship required

Before saying a task is complete, ready to merge, or ship-ready:

```bash
bash scripts/pre-ship.sh
```

Must pass. If it fails, fix and re-run (Kapare step 9 — Verifier).

Do not skip because the change "looks small." Tier T1+ still runs pre-ship.

